# The cask side of the device smoke of device-layer-0013: open a window, load the device page, and answer what it posts
# through the GENERATED dispatcher in ./dispatch.tree, which carries the device contracts to the platform's own API
# through the toolkit host's runtimes. The window is served (`serve`), so the dispatcher knows it and can push a
# watcher's answers into its page (term-device-layer-0002). No window is shown: a test only talks over the bridge.

load @term/cask/cask
  find window
  find open-window
  find load-bundle
  find run

load ./dispatch
  find serve

task boot
  take bundle, like text
  like void
  save made
    call open-window
      text <Term device>
      code 640
      code 480
  call serve
    read made
  call load-bundle
    read made
    read bundle
  call run
